$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 BLUCOMSIG {
  coords 1855.937 -4.674 9493.537
  m_sTitle "Command & signals"
  m_sTextData "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
  "• Company HQ - 1  "\
  "• 1 Platoon HQ - 11  "\
  "• 1 Section - 11A  "\
  "• 2 Section - 11B  "\
  "• 3 Section - 11C  "\
  "• 4 Section - 11D  "\
  ""\
  "• 2 Platoon HQ - 12  "\
  "• 1 Section - 12A  "\
  "• 2 Section - 12B  "\
  "• 3 Section - 12C  "\
  "• 4 Section - 12D  "\
  ""\
  "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
  "• Company Net - 48mhz  "\
  "• 1 Platoon Net - 47.9mhz  "\
  "• 2 Platoon Net - 47.8mhz  "\
  ""\
  "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
  "All passwords can be changed at CO's discretion."\
  "• <b>Challenge:</b> Skater | <b>Password:</b> Boy  "\
  "• Running password: 95  "\
  ""\
  "<h2>PYROTECHNICS</h2>"\
  "• White smoke/flare - Maneuvers and illumination  "\
  "• Green smoke/flare - Friendly location  "\
  "• Red smoke/flare - Enemy location  "
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 6
 }
 BLUEN {
  coords 1883.729 -6.147 9485.146
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Enemy forces consist of the South Atropian People's Army (SAPA), with an estimated strength of 30+ personnel operating within the area."\
  ""\
  "The town only contains the known enemy cell, which currently has complete freedom of movement. Intelligence gathered through Close Target Reconnaissance (CTR) suggests the enemy has established a strongpoint within the building marked on our maps."\
  " They are believed to be carrying supplies and equipment required for their next operation, currently stored within the target building."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Freedom of movement throughout the town and underground. SAPA forces are known to have access to a tunnel system spanning the length of the town, providing concealed routes through multiple access hatches and stairwells."\
  "These tunnels may allow enemy forces to manoeuvre unseen, reposition elements, and conduct ambushes against our troops. Refer to maps for access points."\
  "• SAPA forces make extensive use of light vehicles for mobility. This cell is confirmed to be operating with a BRDM currently located within the town."\
  "• Enemy forces are equipped with older Soviet-era weapons, including AKM rifles, PKM machine guns, SVD marksman rifles, GP/VOG grenade launchers, and light anti-tank capabilities."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 BLUFRIEND {
  coords 1901.836 -2.924 9459.733
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are C Company, 2nd Battalion, The Rifles."\
  "Our force consists of 76 personnel currently assembled at the staging area, GRID: 01090069."\
  ""\
  "Each platoon is organised into a Platoon HQ, three rifle sections, and one machine gun section."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• No indirect fire support is available."\
  "• No supporting friendly units are available."\
  "• No heavy weapon emplacements are available."\
  "• No reinforcements are available."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• Each section has an attached sapper equipped with four demolition charges."\
  "• Each Platoon Sergeant carries one demolition charge and additional GPMG ammunition."\
  "• GPMG ammunition has been cross-loaded throughout the company."\
  "• A supply crate at the staging area contains additional flares and four tactical ladders."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 BLUMIS {
  coords 1894.074 17.116 9581.171
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>  "\
  "Our mission is to conduct a RAID to DESTROY the SAPA supply cache."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>  "\
  "Intelligence has identified a SAPA supply cache within the town, containing equipment and resources intended to support future enemy operations in the region."\
  ""\
  "The cache is currently protected by a SAPA security element occupying a nearby strongpoint. Its destruction will disrupt enemy logistics, limit their ability to conduct further operations, and deny them critical supplies."\
  ""\
  "We are to conduct a rapid assault into the objective area, eliminate any resistance, and destroy the identified supply cache. Expect a determined defence from a motivated and well-equipped enemy force."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 BLUSIT {
  coords 1882.398 -5.484 9487.985
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  "DTL: 12/07/1993, 0530hrs, Longmoor, South of England.  "\
  "Weather: Overcast with heavy rain, dense low-level fog, visibility below 1km, winds up to 6kts. No forecast of improvement."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "Exercise Shadow Light is a joint UK-US training exercise conducted by Alpha Company, 2nd Battalion, The Rifles, in preparation for a possible deployment to the Republic of Atropia."\
  ""\
  "In recent months, the South Atropian People's Army (SAPA) has launched a major offensive, overrunning much of northern Atropia and forcing government forces into a fighting withdrawal. Following a disputed election, elements of the Atropian Government have regrouped in the less populated southern regions, where they continue to resist the advance."\
  ""\
  "Despite international intervention, the situation has continued to deteriorate. With the conflict escalating and SAPA forces making steady territorial gains, British and American forces have begun preparing for a potential deployment. Exercise Shadow Light has been designed to replicate the conditions expected in theatre, ensuring coalition forces are ready should they be called upon."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "UK"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}